{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TBQxAmv4IdecNbslQ51lvQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.926103+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TBQxAmv4IdecNbslQ51lvQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ90tAficwwMVMV5vSvnab1ichJTODI6r5NfxoHdyG4PFcOFGHwrjgGYbdA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ96H6H68lANewO61DeYlsibadVziaSZpGNqAngoibw50YfJcECmZlt2EgZA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9VvJfA9EMj15PQUx1pwgicCZ0hMv9ic9DvpYuMiaAZL5bN6fgGicC2CuibkQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FYxPKVibFqibpfdYZReCYEaelquW5yo4fXNyMWNY0wfDt4yHpyFLjFcw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025年优秀大学生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>暑期学术夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>暨南大学信息科学技术学院</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ96jibicuJ6JyJ0oLmQsftJe2kPQp1RCtficVwU6tQPmZQndC6rF88eNzRQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ96TzmkdIkWLvicCGwwFicTCfjTZRYUuIjgaONkb00HBRcR3rumiascvGyg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ92PqLJ62d2uLAINjibIia0IUQun7XkOh7ic9ibSq898dcOhzqlEl40NJTTA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进与国内高等院校优秀大学生的交流，激发青年学子的科研热情，让更多的学子近距离感受和了解暨南大学信息科学技术学院，我院将于7月举办2025年优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营，欢迎有意向的同学积极报名。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、学院介绍</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9PWRjH3qyMr5eQ9vObgLUsGEQTibkTs838xM1EdqQYoPaBawXTwfkH7g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>信息科学技术学院成立于2001年4月，由数学系、电子工程系、计算机科学系和计算中心组成。学院现拥有计算机科学与技术一级学科博士后流动站，计算机科学与技术、数学博士学位授权一级学科2个，拥有计算机科学与技术、信息与通信工程、数学、电子科学与技术硕士学位授权一级学科4个，与管理学院共建管理科学与工程博士和硕士学位授权一级学科、与经济学院共建概率与数理统计硕士点。有13个科学学位硕士专业，5个专业学位招生专业与领域。有8个本科专业。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9ZDxhoE836RzM5U3zjhoFgIF9t7NGa9Ov1xW8MA6cQOib9t9ndZM0NdQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院拥有1个国家级工程中心，1个教育部工程中心，11个省级工程中心，4个广东省实验教学示范中心，3个国际联合实验室以及1个广东省重点实验室和1个广州市重点实验室。承担国家重点研发计划项目、国家基金杰青项目、国家基金重点以及优青、面上、联合、青年项目、省基金应用基础研究重大专项、省基金杰青以及区域联合重点、面上项目、横向项目等。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ92ajO59ltRyicohyJI2Teqfia8B2hUox05IttneSQgtlkDEwMS8WWt5og/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请条件和报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）申请条件</span></p><p><span>1、品行端正，诚实守信，身心健康，无违法违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span>2、重点大学或重点学科的2025届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>3、对学术研究及应用研究有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事学术与应用研究工作，具有较强的或潜在的科研能力；</span></p><p><span>4、学业优秀，前三年成绩排名在本专业20%以内，在本科科技创新研究或竞赛方面有突出表现，有志于攻读硕士研究生的优先。</span></p><p><span>（二）报名方式</span></p><p><span>1、提交以下申请材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）《暨南大学2025年优秀大学生夏令营申请表》1份（见附件）；</span></p><p><span>（2）个人简历一份（含1000-1500字的研究计划）；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科期间学习成绩单（需加盖所在学校教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>（4）学生证或在读证明；</span></p><p><span>（5）证明在科研或综合能力方面有突出表现的学术论文等科技创新成果或证明材料（该材料不作为必须提供材料，主要供参考）。</span></p><p><span>2、报名时间和申请方式</span></p><p><span>（1）报名时间：即日起至6月30日；</span></p><p><span>（2）请把申请材料原件扫描成电子版，以“2025年学术夏令营-申请人专业-申请人姓名”命名，附件大小不超10M，发送到指定的邮箱：3226214937@qq.com；同时，还需要扫描下方二维码进行线上报名。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9ambianY1TibLz3WWN1CmetZOhzYzU9MgOoIBP70e9KCPhFXKiaQJuz7gw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、资格审核</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院计划招收2025年夏令营学员50-60人（其中市外30-40人），将根据申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等信息进行审核，并拟定于7月2日在学院网站公布2025年夏令营正式学员名单。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（具体活动安排以7月份的安排为准）</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>日期</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>内容</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span><span>地点</span></span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><section><p><span>7月8日</span></p><p><span>周二</span></p></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>上午</span></span></p><p><span><span>8:30-11:30</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>报到、</span></span><span><span>安排住宿</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>南海楼</span></span></p><p><span><span>127室</span></span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span><span>下午</span></span></p><p><span><span>15:00</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>参观校史馆、</span><span><span>图书馆等</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>南海楼前集合</span></span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"4\"><section><p><span>7月9日</span></p><p><span>周三</span></p></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>上午</span></span></p><p><span><span>8:30</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>夏令营开幕式、</span></span><span><span>合影留念</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>南海楼</span></span></p><p><span><span>338</span></span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>上午</span></p><p><span>9:15</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>信息科学技术学院</span></span><span><span>学科情况介绍</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>南海楼</span></p><p><span>338</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span><span>上午</span></span></p><p><span><span>10:00</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>各系导师</span></span></p><p><span><span>见面</span></span><span><span>交流</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span><span>下午</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>学术讲座</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、其他事宜</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请人所提交申请材料必须真实，若有虚假，取消入营资格并通报所在本科学校。</span></p><p><span>2.本次夏令营不收取任何费用，学院为广州市外学员提供夏令营活动期间的住宿（校外酒店或宾馆，共1晚），为所有正式营员提供午餐。请各学员自理往返交通费、人身保险费（保险期为7月7日至7月10日，必须购买，报到时提供保单）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dIynrkiaUS3MTf5teDzNammo9gAE8MJQ9FJkV2Rmpoesoyl4YncsJbA3jnVkibR13BuD1ZjHa0KAgM8SyXKOMzww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>联系老师：李老师</span></p><section><span>联系电话：020-85220216</span></section><section><span>咨询QQ群：275618113</span></section><p><span>信息科学技术学院网址：https://xxxy.jnu.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>信息科学技术学院</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TBQxAmv4IdecNbslQ51lvQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">暨南大学2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表.docx</a></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span>初审 | 李慧芳</span></section><section><span>复审 | 赵承想</span></section><section><span>终审 | 罗国伟</span></section><section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b6458ca1b5826c855198d98f0584b083a2672cc5fc218a10a43cf1bf9799adc0","textLength":1551,"sourceSha256":"be8524365737001405a0766cbed900eb3dd15cb8436916574098eccf5bf96463","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f46b5abbbc79bfaa0e24","title":"2025年暨南大学信息科学技术学院2025年优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.926103+00:00"}
